21:00.180 --> 21:07.100
so let's stay together until the end of time

21:11.660 --> 21:15.440
Let us run together

21:15.440 --> 21:20.160
into our future

21:20.160 --> 21:26.230
I don't care what awaits us

21:21.790 --> 21:24.250
Master!

21:27.650 --> 21:36.110
You are there for me, and you taught me so much

21:34.020 --> 21:36.730
Master!

21:36.110 --> 21:42.980
I'll look up at the sky as I walk the path

21:44.210 --> 21:51.870
that leads into our future

21:50.490 --> 21:52.960
Master, we're here!

21:52.960 --> 21:55.360
You wouldn't <i>believe</i> the day we had!

21:55.360 --> 21:57.250
But it was a lot of fun!

21:58.850 --> 22:01.250
Sorry, girls.

22:20.020 --> 22:26.520
I stand here reflected in your eyes

22:26.520 --> 22:31.800
and make something of a foolish face

22:32.930 --> 22:39.390
Being more gentle than the wind and invincible like the clouds

22:39.390 --> 22:44.340
I want to protect you

22:45.450 --> 22:51.890
Here in the forest I am lost in

22:51.890 --> 22:57.590
I want to try finding a four-leaf clover

22:57.590 --> 23:04.750
The sun is guiding me

23:04.750 --> 23:10.470
towards the miracles of two stars together

23:10.470 --> 23:13.660
Even if we are hurt on the way

23:13.660 --> 23:17.640
and ten years pass

23:17.640 --> 23:24.130
this future where I can be with you is what I choose

23:24.130 --> 23:25.840
We will walk on ahead

23:27.170 --> 23:30.760
and not miss the sun's sign

23:41.510 --> 23:42.810
Okinawa was so much fun!

23:42.810 --> 23:45.310
I wished to see a battle between viper and mongoose.

23:45.310 --> 23:48.090
We bought souvenirs and took tons of pictures!

23:48.090 --> 23:50.230
And we took an airplane home!

23:50.230 --> 23:51.740
Next time on Busou Shinki:

23:51.740 --> 23:54.530
"Attention Please! This Plane Is Experiencing a Descent into Hell."

23:54.530 --> 23:55.280
Wait, <i>Hell</i>?!

23:55.760 --> 23:59.760
It seems a terrorist planted a bomb in our plane!

23:59.760 --> 24:02.250
Why's this show getting serious all of a sudden?

24:02.250 --> 24:05.250
We've been fighting tentacle monsters and having wacky races 'til now!

